# Real-time collaboration

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-A1-realtime-collaboration.md`. Fed: `WF-03-realtime-collaboration.md`.

One project, live co-edit of the canonical store (`playbackStore.recipe`, script, cast, shot plan, playbook). LWW-CRDT per clip in `@cinema/core`; server-authoritative for generation jobs, trained assets, and billing. Presence + document sync use **SSE** (not WebSockets — overlay / project.mdc). Generate = owner/director/editor. Concurrent generate of the same shot is one job (claim + BP-02). Owner account is billed. Pause still applies. Overlay still wins. Do not add a third timeline store.
